{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>荃灣有人猝死。今日（21日）晚上7時許，一名20歲李姓男子在柴灣角街83至93號榮興工業大廈一個單位暈倒，附近人士報案。</p><p>救護員接報到場，證實李男當場死亡，事主死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場是荃灣柴灣角街83至93號榮興工業大廈。（Google街景截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200949744772321280623074.jpeg/7iVdkr9aDAwPw_sAeS7jUvv1Sastj7HF-oNAPvqDQD4\"/><figcaption>現場是荃灣柴灣角街83至93號榮興工業大廈。（Google街景截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T15:43:51.421671+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T15:17:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T07:17:35.772284+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T15:37:25.374438+00:00","content_hash":"d6075379ea59b9d8c6dfd43a48e3b4bf219f23dceb45a2c8b7e69bdbb7e65715","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}